No. of Functional Features Included in the Solution
1. User Management

Creation and management of authorized users.

2. Role Management

Assignment of roles for controlling permissions.

3. Table Management

Creation of the Institution Details table.

4. Field Management

Configuration of required table fields.

5. Record Management

Creation and management of institution records.

6. READ Access Control

Controls record viewing permissions.

7. CREATE Access Control

Controls record creation permissions.

8. WRITE Access Control

Controls record modification permissions.

9. DELETE Access Control

Controls record deletion permissions.

10. Branch-Based Restriction

Controls access according to the Branch field.

11. Administrator Access

Provides complete access to administrators.

12. Access Testing

Validates the configured permissions and restrictions.
